      2. I recall signing a document/agreement during my last appraisal
      that mentioned a 90-day notice period.<br>
      3. During our recent discussion, I understood that the company was
      proceeding with a 30-day separation/notice period.<br>
      <br>
      <b>Could you please confirm which terms are applicable in my case
        and share the relevant document for my reference?</b><br>
      <br>
      I appreciate your support and would like to ensure that the
      transition is handled professionally and smoothly. I will continue
      to cooperate with the required handover and transition activities
      once the applicable terms and last working date are confirmed.<br>
      <br>
      Thank you for your understanding.<br>
      <br>
      Regards,<br>
      Rahul<br>
